1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:57,370
This person has been chasing me all the way from Zhao

25
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:00,530
and I still can't determine his cultivation level.

26
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:11,770
Even if you have the stones to operate the teleportation formation,

27
00:02:09,550 --> 00:02:12,730
Na Duo
Five Elements Planet's cultivator
Early stage Soul Transformation

28
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:13,450
do you think you can escape ?

29
00:02:14,850 --> 00:02:16,530
What a powerful Divine Sense !

30
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,330
After a single attack,

31
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:24,810
my Nascent Soul is already at the brink of collapse.

32
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:26,530
What's...

33
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:28,890
his cultivation level ?

34
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:33,330
His power feels familiar...

35
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,050
Could it be ?

36
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:38,010
This cannot continue,

37
00:02:38,440 --> 00:02:40,010
I cannot let him take the initiative,

38
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,490
cause if he does, I will die.

39
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,930
I need to fight back to survive.

40
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:57,050
His flag isn't finished.

41
00:02:57,190 --> 00:03:00,130
If he finishes is, it will trigger a tribulation.

42
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:03,970
I didn't expect

43
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:06,490
to find this kind of artifact

44
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:08,650
on this waste of a planet.

45
00:03:09,180 --> 00:03:10,730
Fortunately, before this trip,

46
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:13,170
I refined another nearly-finished restriction flag.

47
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:15,170
Looks like it can threaten him.

48
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,330
Senior has been following me

49
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,530
with great killing intent.

50
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,490
What does Senior want from me ?

51
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:23,450
If my cultivation was at its prime,

52
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,410
this would be easy.

53
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:26,650
But I only recovered 30% of my power...

54
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:29,690
if I fight a tribulation now, I will get hurt again.

55
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:34,490
Junior, give me the bag you found in the Land of the Ancient God.

56
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,430
The Land of the Ancient God ?

57
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:46,170
Is this what Senior wants ?

58
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,730
That's right.

59
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,330
In the past,

60
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:53,410
I got seriously injured.

61
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:56,810
So I went to the Land of the Ancient God to find treasures to help me recover.

62
00:03:57,120 --> 00:04:00,050
I got into some trouble there.

63
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:02,770
The Blood Sea Warriors chased me

64
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:05,370
so in order to safeguard my findings,

65
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:07,370
I had no other choice

66
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:09,570
but to hide my bag of holding.

67
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:12,170
I wanted to take it back later.

68
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,570
But as you know,

69
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:16,740
it ended up in your hands.

70
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,370
I have returned the bag to you,

71
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,130
I will now take my leave.

72
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:45,650
Stop !

73
00:04:45,420 --> 00:04:46,750
Little friend,

74
00:04:46,530 --> 00:04:47,690
don't be rash !

75
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:50,370
Why did Senior go back on his word ?

76
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:52,450
Was the red lightning you used before

77
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:53,570
the Ji Realm ?

78
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:59,610
Junior, you really are full of surprises.

79
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:02,690
Not only do you have a treasure that can attract a tribulation

80
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,410
but you also have the Ji Realm.

81
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:06,610
If Senior doesn't have anything else

82
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:08,710
then Junior will take his leave.

83
00:05:08,090 --> 00:05:11,390
Do you want to breakthrough your Ji Realm bottleneck ?

84
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:14,570
Little friend,

85
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:15,810
do you know what this is ?

86
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,650
Ji Realm ?

87
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,690
On my home planet,

88
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:25,570
it's called the Five Colored Ji Realm.

89
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:27,530
This wasn't originally mine.

90
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:29,490
It was gifted to me by a friend

91
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:31,090
as he was dying.

92
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:35,170
You remind me of him.

93
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:37,330
In the whole Cultivation Alliance,

94
00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:39,970
Ji Realm cultivators are very rare.

95
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:42,780
I cannot tell the properties of your Ji Realm

96
00:05:42,540 --> 00:05:45,050
but I know how you can breakthrough.

97
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:48,170
The Cultivation Planet Crystal is given

98
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,810
to a country when it reaches rank 6.

99
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:52,930
The old monsters of the Cultivation Alliance use their powers

100
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:54,810
to form the crystal.

101
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:59,130
It's a rank 6 cultivation country's national treasure.

102
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:01,130
If you obtain and refine it,

103
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:03,850
you can breakthrough your Ji Realm.

104
00:06:08,520 --> 00:06:11,210
If you obtain the crystal and get the qualifications

105
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:13,770
to leave this waste of a planet

106
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:16,330
you can come find me on the Five Elements Planet,

107
00:06:16,640 --> 00:06:18,530
my name is Na Duo.

108
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:25,210
Luckily, I managed to avoid this fight.

109
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:36,330
If I can reach Soul Transformation

110
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:39,340
then I may have a chance to get the Cultivation Planet Crystal

111
00:06:39,110 --> 00:06:40,770
to breakthrough my Ji Realm.

112
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:43,310
But for now,

113
00:06:43,070 --> 00:06:45,210
I need to reach Soul Formation.

114
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:48,250
Understanding the heavens

115
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:49,970
is crucial for that.

116
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:52,050
But I have spent my whole life

117
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:54,050
following the demonic path.

118
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:56,770
If I want to breakthrough,

119
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:58,250
there is only one way:

120
00:06:57,320 --> 00:07:00,650
Wang Lin's avatar
Early stage Nascent Soul

121
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:02,330
becoming a mortal.

122
00:07:07,210 --> 00:07:09,890
Four Sect Alliance

123
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:28,850
The Four Sect Alliance

124
00:07:29,200 --> 00:07:31,260
is a rank 4 cultivation country.

125
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:38,890
Lu Xing

126
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:38,490
Let's rest here.

127
00:07:43,440 --> 00:07:44,610
Go ahead.

128
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:45,170
Alright.

129
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:47,210
Sir, are you passing by or staying ?

130
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:49,770
I see that you carry medicinal herbs in your backpack.

131
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:51,020
I wonder if Brother

132
00:07:50,780 --> 00:07:52,610
could possibly be a traveling doctor ?

133
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:55,930
I am Lu Xing.

134
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:56,730
Brother,

135
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:58,530
do you have any medicine

136
00:07:58,560 --> 00:08:01,080
to cure the evil wind. (regular cold)

137
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:02,170
Is someone sick ?

138
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:04,850
A servant girl is sick.

139
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:07,690
We are still 7 days away from the capital

140
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:09,730
and the medecine prescribed by the doctor

141
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:11,210
isn't very effective.

142
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,690
Perhaps...

143
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:15,490
this is my opportunity to enter the mortal world.

144
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:17,490
Please lead the way.

145
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,610
Please.

146
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:26,970
Brother,

147
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:28,090
just look from here,

148
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:29,570
there is no need to go inside.

149
00:08:31,400 --> 00:08:32,770
Please stretch out your hand.

150
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:43,070
She clearly isn't a servant, but the master.

151
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:44,970
Poison ?

152
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:57,370
Have her eat it raw, she will be cured by tomorrow.

153
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,170
This...

154
00:08:58,760 --> 00:09:01,770
This looks like an ordinary willow tree leaf.

155
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:06,610
I'm afraid this guy isn't a doctor.

156
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:08,250
He is clearly a lunatic.

157
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:12,930
A hundred-years old willow leaf !

158
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,890
I don't know how to consume it.

159
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:18,770
Is there any trick to using this leaf ?

160
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,250
Eating it raw is fine.

161
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:43,650
I didn't expect that in just 400 years,

162
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:46,490
I could accumulate so much killing intent.

163
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,250
I killed way too many people...

164
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:51,730
If I allow this aura to grow,

165
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:53,050
over time,

166
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:55,450
it will corrupt my Dao Heart.

167
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:58,130
The killing intent can be domineering

168
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,530
and used for spells.

169
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,930
But if I want to turn into a mortal

170
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:04,570
it will ententually dissipate.

171
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:06,890
It's a pity...

172
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:24,730
The best I can do is condense it.

173
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,570
That's fine.

174
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,590
Hey Brother,

175
00:10:27,350 --> 00:10:29,250
your leaves are really magical.

176
00:10:29,160 --> 00:10:30,230
My daught-

177
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:33,010
My servant feels much better.

178
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:35,770
Come on,

179
00:10:35,520 --> 00:10:36,970
let's toast !

180
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:48,500
It's been a long time since I drank with someone.

181
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:51,810
Come on, cheers !

182
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:01,010
Old man,

183
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:04,770
I've heard you talk about Xing Fen Tower countless times.

184
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:06,050
Enough.

185
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:07,210
This time,

186
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:09,930
I will see if you're just bragging.

187
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,010
Go ahead.

188
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:12,810
You'll be drunk soon anyway.

189
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:15,700
I'll wait for you to pass out and I'll start.

190
00:11:15,460 --> 00:11:16,880
No...

191
00:11:16,660 --> 00:11:17,510
You...

192
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:21,370
Let's toast for him !

193
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:23,290
What a drinker !

194
00:11:23,040 --> 00:11:24,370
Come, cheers!

195
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:28,730
You should drink less, we have to keep guard.

196
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:30,050
It's been a long time

197
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:32,330
since I saw this side of Life.

198
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:49,900
Today, without noticing,

199
00:11:49,690 --> 00:11:52,120
I absorbed spiritual energy extremely fast.

200
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:53,250
Wang Lin's avatar
Middle stage Nascent Soul

201
00:11:52,640 --> 00:11:55,210
It made me breakthrough to the Middle stage already.

202
00:11:56,040 --> 00:11:58,370
It seems that distancing myself from cultivation

203
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,490
to become a mortal

204
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:01,170
is the right path.

205
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:02,810
Now, I will dance for you guys.

206
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:03,890
Let's have fun !

207
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:05,370
Have fun ?

208
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:07,570
Am I making a fool of myself ?

209
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:09,210
Of course you are !

210
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:13,330
Look over here !

211
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:15,010
Quality woven clothes !

212
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:17,330
Cold powder ! Cold powder !

213
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,670
Brother Wang,

214
00:12:21,450 --> 00:12:23,120
don't keep staring at them.

215
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:25,530
If you are noticed, we will be troubled.

216
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:26,810
Brother Lu,

217
00:12:26,920 --> 00:12:28,570
what are these black pillars ?

218
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:30,890
Those are Immortal pillars.

219
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:33,090
This place is my country's capital

220
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:35,450
so it's protected by Immortals, hence the Immortal pillars.

221
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:38,490
There are Immortals living inside the pillars.

222
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:41,880
Although they are merely Foundation Establishment,

223
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:43,610
it's rare to protect the mortal world like that,

224
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:45,050
very rare.

225
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:48,650
I didn't expect you to know so much about Immortals.

226
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:52,010
What's the meaning of the Four Sect Alliance ?

227
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:54,410
There are 4 cultivation sects

228
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:56,410
in our country.

229
00:12:57,040 --> 00:13:00,410
The righteous and virtuous White Cloud Sect.

230
00:13:01,400 --> 00:13:04,850
The Water Ink Sect, with its bustling rivers and waterfalls.

231
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:09,130
The Green Wood Sect, blessed by the sky and the earth.

232
00:13:09,400 --> 00:13:13,370
And the Black Soul Sect, hidden in darkness.

233
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:16,770
These 4 sects are relatively independent.

234
00:13:16,680 --> 00:13:18,870
They each collect disciples in the mortal world.

235
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:22,020
Whenever there's a big event, they cooperate.

236
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:24,490
That's why it's called the Four Sect Alliance.

237
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:27,010
To be honest,

238
00:13:26,920 --> 00:13:29,690
my dream was to become an Immortal.

239
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:32,810
But the crown prince was so kind to me.

240
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:34,770
If it weren't for that,

241
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:37,730
I might have become an Immortal.

242
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:41,810
I heard that cultivation depends on talent and opportunity.

243
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:43,210
It's not something you decide.

244
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:45,130
Life is short.

245
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:48,050
It's better to be happy here.

246
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:51,370
You know me well Brother !

247
00:13:53,760 --> 00:13:54,570
Brother Lu,

248
00:13:54,850 --> 00:13:56,600
let's part ways here.

249
00:13:58,880 --> 00:14:00,450
The young lady asked me to thank you.

250
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:01,810
Here are 10 taels of gold,

251
00:14:01,640 --> 00:14:03,010
consider it your payment.

252
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:03,010
Note: 1 tael = 37.5g

253
00:14:03,680 --> 00:14:04,730
Thank you.

254
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:20,090
Spoiler

255
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:18,130
You old pervert !

256
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:20,410
You came to my shop to see the women changing their clothes ?

257
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:22,080
Deserved !

258
00:14:20,710 --> 00:14:23,130
At such an age, how could you be so lewd ?

259
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:25,250
I'll hit you every time I see you !

260
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:26,930
Get lost !

261
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:28,970
I'll beat you to death !

262
00:14:29,040 --> 00:14:30,170
Alright.

263
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:33,850
Hey

264
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:34,650
young man,

265
00:14:34,650 --> 00:14:36,850
your forehead is wide,

266
00:14:34,650 --> 00:14:36,900
(Note: sign of luck, talent)

267
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:38,210
energy envelops your body,

268
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,730
you must be special !

269
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:42,010
I've hidden my cultivation.

270
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:44,050
This person is just a mortal,

271
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:45,930
he cannot see through me.

272
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:48,770
If no one guides you,

273
00:14:48,520 --> 00:14:51,290
I'm afraid you will never reach Soul Formation.

274
00:14:51,680 --> 00:14:52,910
What a pity !

275
00:14:52,690 --> 00:14:54,420
How pitiful...

276
00:14:54,250 --> 00:14:55,330
Who are you ?

277
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:58,490
You don't need to know who I am.

278
00:14:58,560 --> 00:15:03,090
But I know how to make you reach Soul Formation.

279
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:11,260
Senior,

280
00:15:11,010 --> 00:15:12,410
please teach me.

281
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:15,010
I'm getting old.

282
00:15:14,920 --> 00:15:16,850
The moment I get hungry,

283
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:19,130
I can't remember anything.

284
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:21,930
I know a very good restaurant.

285
00:15:21,760 --> 00:15:24,970
Let's go there and talk while we eat.

286
00:15:27,800 --> 00:15:28,850
Delicious !

287
00:15:29,640 --> 00:15:30,690
It smells so good.

288
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:33,650
Bring me another duck !

289
00:15:33,400 --> 00:15:35,090
And 2 jars of wine !

290
00:15:38,760 --> 00:15:41,050
Try some, it's so good.

291
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:42,370
Tell me.

292
00:15:42,180 --> 00:15:44,050
How can I reach Soul Formation ?

293
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:47,540
This, it's easy.

294
00:15:47,340 --> 00:15:49,210
Wait until I finish eating this piece

295
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:53,090
This old man is really strange.

296
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:55,450
He can see through my cultivation.

297
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:57,890
If it's not a coincidence,

298
00:15:58,680 --> 00:16:00,210
then his cultivation

299
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:01,890
must be at least Soul Formation.

300
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:13,490
The Soul Formation stage requires one to understand the heavens

301
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:16,490
but I believe you already know that.

302
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:17,530
In addition,

303
00:16:17,520 --> 00:16:19,290
to reach Soul Formation

304
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:21,590
you must form your own...

305
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:23,290
domain.

306
00:16:24,160 --> 00:16:26,440
Do you know what a domain is ?

307
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,770
Young man,

308
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:32,250
reflect on this.

309
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:34,500
Once you comprehend what a domain is,

310
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:37,020
you won't be far from Soul Forma...

311
00:16:42,970 --> 00:16:44,410
...tion

312
00:16:45,920 --> 00:16:48,090
I need to use the restroom.

313
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:49,450
Let's continue when I get back.

314
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:21,770
Young man,

315
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:24,090
your forehead is wide,

316
00:17:23,840 --> 00:17:25,650
energy envelops your body,

317
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:26,600
you must be special !

318
00:17:26,360 --> 00:17:27,490
Go away.

319
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:31,250
What a pity...

320
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:33,410
If no one guides you,

321
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:36,450
I'm afraid you will never reach Core Formation.

322
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:38,530
Who are you ?

323
00:17:39,520 --> 00:17:41,970
You don't need to know who I am.

324
00:17:42,520 --> 00:17:43,530
This old man

325
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:46,020
doesn't scam randomly.

326
00:17:50,080 --> 00:17:51,450
Young man,

327
00:17:51,560 --> 00:17:53,170
if no one guides you,

328
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:54,930
I'm afraid you will never reach Nascent Soul.

329
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:56,850
You don't need to know who I am.

330
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:59,330
Let's find a place to relax

331
00:17:59,280 --> 00:18:02,050
and have a good time.

332
00:18:02,360 --> 00:18:03,480
Okay.

333
00:18:11,480 --> 00:18:12,570
Young man,

334
00:18:12,440 --> 00:18:14,450
how long do you plan to rent ?

335
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:23,450
This is the craft of our family.

336
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:24,970
Look carefully.

337
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:28,250
Tie Zhu won't work with you in the future.

338
00:18:28,320 --> 00:18:30,130
When I save enough money

339
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:32,330
you will go to the capital

340
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:33,650
to become an official.

341
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,250
Young man, look.

342
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:41,050
There's a garden in the back.

343
00:18:51,480 --> 00:18:53,450
Although this shop has been empty for many years

344
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:54,450
and is dirty,

345
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:56,410
you should have everything you need.

346
00:18:56,640 --> 00:18:57,690
I take it.

347
00:18:58,400 --> 00:18:59,330
This much ?

348
00:18:59,090 --> 00:19:00,570
The place is yours then !

349
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:18,610
You won't catch me !

350
00:19:18,680 --> 00:19:19,690
Wait a second !

351
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:22,030
I'm sure I can catch you !

352
00:19:21,780 --> 00:19:23,370
No you won't  !

353
00:19:23,360 --> 00:19:24,460
Be careful,

354
00:19:24,220 --> 00:19:25,290
don't make trouble.

355
00:19:26,280 --> 00:19:27,890
Hidden from the world

356
00:19:28,400 --> 00:19:29,770
in a city of mortals.

357
00:19:31,040 --> 00:19:33,330
Far away for the bloody cultivation path,

358
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:35,290
living life as a mortal.

359
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:36,970
Maybe,

360
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:40,410
this is really the way to understand the heavens.

361
00:19:45,720 --> 00:19:46,850
Old man,

362
00:19:47,090 --> 00:19:48,720
what do you want to do tonight ?

363
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:50,260
Nascent Soul...

364
00:19:50,030 --> 00:19:52,650
Middle stage Nascent Soul ?

365
00:19:53,730 --> 00:19:56,450
Should I help him ?

366
00:19:58,830 --> 00:22:45,240
As I mentioned before in the note of episode 32, the story of that bag of holding differs between the donghua and the novel. Na Duo was cultivating in the War God Shrine a technique to absorb the death energy of corpses. He was severly injured in combat and was recovering from his injuries there for thousands of years and Wang Lin stole his bag while he was uncounscious in his corpse state.

The explanation of "I hid it there for later" makes very little sense. When you know that Na Duo was so heavily injured that he literally became a corpse in a sect's graveyard in order to recover, the donghua's explanation pales in comparison.

367
00:20:06,770 --> 00:20:10,900
I've had my share of wounds,

368
00:20:08,810 --> 00:20:10,900
now I want to fight back.

369
00:20:10,730 --> 00:20:14,460
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

370
00:20:14,290 --> 00:20:20,380
that's blocking all my hopes

371
00:20:17,170 --> 00:20:20,380
for life ?

372
00:20:21,930 --> 00:20:26,140
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

373
00:20:23,650 --> 00:20:26,140
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

374
00:20:26,210 --> 00:20:29,540
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

375
00:20:29,650 --> 00:20:35,540
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

376
00:20:32,370 --> 00:20:35,540
out of reach.

377
00:20:36,650 --> 00:20:41,020
Immortals

378
00:20:37,690 --> 00:20:41,020
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

379
00:20:41,050 --> 00:20:45,060
Renegades

380
00:20:41,810 --> 00:20:45,060
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

381
00:20:44,810 --> 00:20:48,900
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

382
00:20:46,760 --> 00:20:48,900
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

383
00:20:48,890 --> 00:20:53,020
because I don't see the harm in that.

384
00:20:54,770 --> 00:21:00,820
My new body opens its eyes

385
00:20:57,290 --> 00:21:00,820
and awakens from its dream.

386
00:21:00,690 --> 00:21:08,380
I have overcome many trials

387
00:21:02,810 --> 00:21:08,380
to get this body back.

388
00:21:08,330 --> 00:21:16,020
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

389
00:21:12,370 --> 00:21:16,020
I can still see.

390
00:21:16,170 --> 00:21:25,380
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

391
00:21:20,130 --> 00:21:25,380
by my own hands.

392
00:21:56,010 --> 00:22:02,220
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

393
00:21:58,730 --> 00:22:02,220
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

394
00:22:01,970 --> 00:22:09,780
With a flick of a finger,

395
00:22:03,410 --> 00:22:09,780
only my indomitable heart remains.

396
00:22:09,570 --> 00:22:19,180
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

397
00:22:15,530 --> 00:22:19,180
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

398
00:22:19,170 --> 00:22:27,020
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

399
00:22:21,690 --> 00:22:27,020
like the descent of a god.
